rl": "pic.x.com/uwaTeI9lMl", "end": 81, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SalynnaCinchic/status/2119455899542581644/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119455888008269824", "start": 58, "url": "https://t.co/uwaTeI9lMl"}]}, "id": "2119455899542581644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 212, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "周一开盘前都给我念起来，禅定会不会？把它禅定你们怎么接收宇宙信息？\n❂ 佛说摩诃迦罗大黑天神大福德圆满陀罗尼经 ❂ https://t.co/uwaTeI9lMl", "url": "https://x.com/SalynnaCinchic/status/2119455899542581644"}, {"author_id": "1402561715296944128", "created_at": "2026-11-08T07:23:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119329506519371828", "2119329898745548840"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QSsRpUBEs6", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bookwormgz/status/2119329898745548840/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119329485690441728", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/QSsRpUBEs6"}]}, "id": "2119329898745548840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "成语小知识\n阿斗太子\n[成语解释]阿斗：三国蜀汉刘备之子刘禅的小名。此人庸碌无能，虽有诸葛亮等人全力扶助，也不能振兴蜀汉。指懦弱无能的人\n[典故出处]：高阳《胡雪岩全传 灯火楼台》：“丈夫是个阿斗太子，哪怕你是诸葛亮，也只好叹口气。”\n[ 近义词 ]：扶不起的阿斗\n[常用程度]：常用 https://t.co/QSsRpUBEs6", "url": "https://x.com/bookwormgz/status/2119329898745548840"}, {"author_id": "1402561715296944128", "created_at": "2026-11-08T07:21:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119329506519371828", "2119329898745548840"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Tx7HKMYvI3", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/bookwormgz/status/2119329506519371828/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119329485690441728", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/Tx7HKMYvI3"}]}, "id": "2119329506519371828", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "成语小知识\n阿斗太子\n[成语解释]阿斗：三国蜀汉刘备之子刘禅的小名。此人庸碌无能，虽有诸葛亮等人全力扶助，也不能振兴蜀汉。指懦弱无能的人\n[典故出处]：高阳《胡雪岩全传 灯火楼台》：“丈夫是个阿斗太子，哪怕你是诸葛亮，也只好叹口气。”\n[ 近义词 ]：扶不起的阿斗\n[常用程度]：常用 https://t.co/Tx7HKMYvI3", "url": "https://x.com/bookwormgz/status/2119329506519371828"}, {"author_id": "1722322678047252480", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:00:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119414849042305127"], "id": "2119414849042305127", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "好像如果正经修佛的话，需要先修定，大概就是欲界定，然后未到地定，接着才能初禅。有足够的定力才好修观。这里面到未到地定就已经有些离谱了，需要心中只剩随缘。比如说你观自己呼吸，你就必须把自己的身体，坐垫，全都忘掉，感知中只空余这个呼吸。我只能说你释迦牟尼老哥还是有真功夫的", "url": "https://x.com/xia_shui9837/status/2119414849042305127"}, {"author_id": "1879736704128716800", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:02:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118856588274672084"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 55, "id": "10228272", "start": 47, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.", "display_url": "youtube.com/shorts/ZphQRib…", "end": 43, "expanded_url": "https://youtube.com/shorts/ZphQRibz3DY?si=B9d-zPpljiaD_wNL", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118856588434006016/jBQOu8XS?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 405}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118856588434006016/jBQOu8XS?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 20, "status": 200, "title": "🌸 佛法智慧《无常不是失去，而是觉醒》", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/ZphQRibz3DY?si=B9d-zPpljiaD_wNL", "url": "https://t.co/aaCp7pqCes"}]}, "id": "2118856588274672084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌸 佛法智慧《无常不是失去，而是觉醒》 https://t.co/aaCp7pqCes 来自 @YouTube\n\n🌸 佛法智慧《无常不是失去，而是觉醒》\n\n世间万物，\n没有一样能够永远不变。\n\n花开了，会凋谢；\n人相聚了，会离散；\n身体健康，也会逐渐衰老。\n\n这就是佛法所说的——无常。\n\n许多人害怕无常，\n因为害怕失去。", "url": "https://x.com/sun780500/status/2118856588274672084"}, {"author_id": "1696757524303691776", "created_at": "2026-11-08T02:27:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119255554921308547"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 37, "start": 32, "tag": "同志会所"}, {"end": 105, "start": 100, "tag": "同志据点"}, {"end": 131, "start": 121, "tag": "gayhostel"}, {"end": 140, "start": 132, "tag": "gayclub"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ryyUPt8RoT", "end": 164, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/scorpy113156567/status/2119255554921308547/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119255038224896000", "start": 141, "url": "https://t.co/ryyUPt8RoT"}]}, "id": "2119255554921308547", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2090, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "（转自交流群）佛山禅城中公附近这些年陆续也开过好几家这样的小型 ＃同志会所，目前似乎只剩双鸽这一家。有群友去打卡，说老板是位老爷子，里面环境不咋地，不过照里似乎看着还算干净，主要是方便晚上在旁边公园 ＃同志据点 玩晚了不方便回家的基友过夜吧。＃gayhostel ＃gayclub https://t.co/ryyUPt8RoT", "url": "https://x.com/scorpy113156567/status/2119255554921308547"}, {"author_id": "1618397562897154048", "created_at": "2026-11-08T12:57:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119414056524099956"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB5PYaa-yClD2AA1?pwd=girk", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB5PYaa-yClD2AA1?pwd=girk", "url": "https://t.co/xYsFuPOAw1"}]}, "id": "2119414056524099956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 26041, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/xYsFuPOAw1 \n\n《初恋限定指南》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《失眠飞行》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《双向诱捕攻略》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《私有浪漫》作者:5t5mine\n《停电》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《心动逃逸》作者:5t5mine-番全\n\n《虚伪兄弟》作者:艾恳-番全", "url": "https://x.com/yurme74286573/status/2119414056524099956"}, {"author_id": "536470999", "created_at": "2026-11-08T11:28:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119391676288606675"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ssY_xp3s5…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ssY_xp3s5ZzPewzg1nGZXA1?pwd=dmft", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ssY_xp3s5ZzPewzg1nGZXA1?pwd=dmft", "url": "https://t.co/378SAI10m6"}]}, "id": "2119391676288606675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 20904, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/378SAI10m6\n\n《初恋限定指南》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《失眠飞行》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《双向诱捕攻略》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《私有浪漫》作者:5t5mine\n《停电》作者:5t5mine-番全\n《心动逃逸》作者:5t5mine-番全\n\n《虚伪兄弟》作者:艾恳-番全\n《呻Y》作者:艾恳", "url": "https://x.com/beyzakr5/status/2119391676288606675"}, {"author_id": "1263347158050209794", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:20:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118861228369908033"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Rd1TVqaQmE", "end": 159, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/XuyunChanshi/status/2118861228369908033/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118861183717392384", "start": 136, "url": "https://t.co/Rd1TVqaQmE"}]}, "id": "2118861228369908033", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "晨起，法门这么多，你要跟哪一门？\n\n虚云老和尚开示：「勿贪多法，只要心专。」\n\n不是教人少学、闭塞——是勘你那颗心。今天看这段经，明天换那个咒，后天又跟一个新法门；表面精进，实则心散。法不是少，是你这一念提不起。贪多，正是妄心在找新鲜刺激；心专，才是死心塌地在一处用功。 https://t.co/Rd1TVqaQmE", "url": "https://x.com/XuyunChanshi/status/2118861228369908033"}, {"author_id": "2060627878736461824", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:44:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119199373339103359"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PU5HS1ra7n", "end": 118, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cngaohui/status/2119199373339103359/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119199354959605760", "start": 95, "url": "https://t.co/PU5HS1ra7n"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/PU5HS1ra7n", "end": 118, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/cngaohui/status/2119199373339103359/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119199365931978752", "start": 95, "url": "https://t.co/PU5HS1ra7n"}]}, "id": "2119199373339103359", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 8858, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人一直有两个疑问：白百何是不是靠着陈羽凡出道？当年的“一指禅”，到底是谁先出轨的？\n \n白百何中戏读书时，大三接了个戏《与青春有关的日子》，和当时已经大火的羽泉成员陈羽凡因戏相识相恋。 https://t.co/PU5HS1ra7n", "url": "https://x.com/cngaohui/status/2119199373339103359"}, {"author_id": "2030469585703665664", "created_at": "2026-11-07T15:26:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119089027861401873"], "id": "2119089027861401873", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "“要怎么做才会内心平静呢？”", "url": "https://x.com/rich_raccoon8/status/2119089027861401873"}, {"author_id": "1751866112793554944", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:18:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119237970012369350"], "id": "2119237970012369350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 608, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "嘉靖四十五年二月，户部主事海瑞买了一口棺材，遣散僮仆，与妻子诀别，然后递上一封奏疏。疏里最狠的一句是：“嘉靖者，言家家皆净而无财用也。”一个六品小官，替天下人跟皇帝算总账。", "url": "https://x.com/liqing_xing/status/2119237970012369350"}, {"author_id": "1606113722967244801", "created_at": "2026-11-08T10:26:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119376003600441723"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/OUL7iHlWHp", "end": 149, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/teslamillion/status/2119376003600441723/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119375986227568640", "start": 126, "url": "https://t.co/OUL7iHlWHp"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/OUL7iHlWHp", "end": 149, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/teslamillion/status/2119376003600441723/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119375986244354048", "start": 126, "url": "https://t.co/OUL7iHlWHp"}]}, "id": "2119376003600441723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "潑墨仙人\n\n《潑墨仙人》为南宋时期绘画作品，时年约西元960-1279年间，出自山東東平人梁楷之手。梁楷活动于十三世纪上半叶，是南宋宫廷画家，以其不拘礼法、嗜酒自乐的个性闻名，自号“梁风子”。作品采用纸本水墨技法，尺寸纵48.7公分，横27.7公分。 https://t.co/OUL7iHlWHp", "url": "https://x.com/teslamillion/status/2119376003600441723"}, {"author_id": "2111532677568647168", "created_at": "2026-11-08T04:18:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119283365279072547"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 78, "start": 73, "tag": "科创50"}, {"end": 82, "start": 79, "tag": "缠论"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "sjyclh.top", "end": 72, "expanded_url": "https://sjyclh.top", "start": 49, "status": 200, "title": "手姐云缠量化", "unwound_url": "https://sjyclh.top", "url": "https://t.co/MckunUOFBM"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/9MHQ8Gw1mj", "end": 106, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/sjyclh_top/status/2119283365279072547/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119283295418744832", "start": 83, "url": "https://t.co/9MHQ8Gw1mj"}]}, "id": "2119283365279072547", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今周看法 --- 科创50 ---\n手姐云缠量化 - 让更多普通人见识缠论量化的威力！\n试用地址：https://t.co/MckunUOFBM\n#科创50 #缠论 https://t.co/9MHQ8Gw1mj", "url": "https://x.com/sjyclh_top/status/2119283365279072547"}, {"author_id": "1991165107691454464", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:23:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119239240773243103"], "id": "2119239240773243103", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 910, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "乾隆到底是什么样的人？\n\n封建皇帝的顶峰，没有之一。\n\n毫不夸张的说，乾隆是最完美的封建君主，也是命最好的封建君主。\n\n注意，这些都是从封建皇权的角度对他的评价，乾隆达到了封建帝王的最高点。\n\n当然，某种意义上，他作为一个封建君主越完美，对于国家而言就是一场灾难。", "url": "https://x.com/itsdawn_logs/status/2119239240773243103"}, {"author_id": "1596880215556296704", "created_at": "2026-11-07T18:47